    anlanote = {Video mostly in Beta format:Association of stranded Rural Alaskans in Anchorage: a periodical with this title is in Goldmine :ALASKA PER HD2330 B86.UAF - Level 2 - ALASKA PER Periodical 1Drum Lake Archeology, Bill Stewart A117 6015: not in GoldmineUSFWS proposed refuges: Kuskokwim Delta, Togiak: not in GoldmineFocus North 4-18-85: Possibly:AAF-5004 FILM ARCHIVESUAF - Level 4 - ARCHIVAL VIDEOS Archival Video 1Alaska Review: ANCSA Inquiry- Part 1, The Spirit of ANCSA: Aspirations of Alaska NativesMake Prayers to the Raven, The Bible and Distant Time. Possibly: ALASKA PER E99 A86 T37.UAF - Level 2 - ALASKA PER Periodical 1Interpreters Career Show Video; Dept of Culture and Communications Govt. of the NWT. Possibly related:ALASKA PER LE3.5 A7 A3.UAF - Level 2 - ALASKA PER Periodical 1Home Maintenance (CMHC), Gov't of the NWT. Not in Goldmine},
