    comments = {Date approximate.These video tapes were donated to ANLA by Oscar and Sophie Alexie in 2011. They were sorted and a decision was made to keep the ones with probable Native Language content in the Archive. No attempt was made to play any of these tapes, they were sorted on the basis of labels only. The Native Language tapes were assigned to CY978A-Video and numbered 01-14 with individual tapes listed for each box.CY978A-Video-15 to CY978-Video-21 are boxes that contain video of questionable value to ANLA because of a suspected lack of Native language. These boxes should perhaps be donated to the Rasmuson Library. Where possible, links to records with similar names found in Goldmine are listed with the tapes.The tapes are currently in storage in the Annex},
