r published form (such as videotape, radio shows, etc.). Use for Koyukon dictionary is permitted and use in classroom is permitted. 4 November 99. I left a photocopy of the release in the file and moved the original to the donor files. Check with Eliza Jones, Susan Paskvan or somebody if Moses is still living; if not, who might be his authorized representative. Rose Speranza, June 7, 08.<td colspan="1">f.9 previously foldered as KO987Kn.d. 1: Kwaraceius – Scientific Name Index for Koyukon Biota; Manuscript.<td colspan="1">The notes seem to have been written in preparation for publication of the Koyukon Athabaskan Dictionary [Jette and Jones, 2000].<td colspan="1">},
