    anlanote = {Why is Tlingit not an Athabaskan Language: And Introduction to Tlingit for Athabaskanists"In this paper I will present some comparisons and contrasts between Tlingit (Eng./ˈklɪŋˌkɪt/, not */t(ə)lɪŋgɪt/) and the Athabaskan languages. This is not meant to be a comprehensive study, but merely a shallow survey of some of the more interesting features which can be compared between the languages."ca.30},
